 for later visual coverage issues.\n- No SourceFigureAsset or VLM dependency is introduced.\n- No Smart Mark, source-authority scoring, rubric-ready, launch-ready, rights approval, SourceFigureAsset acceptance, Supabase mutation, or Phase B2 eligibility claim is made.\n- Actual UI binding remains pending for #1163.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/text-first-runtime-wording-handoff.test.js` passed: 6 tests.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-text-first-runtime-wording-handoff.mjs --check` passed: 15 validator checks; generated handoff/readback match checked-in outputs.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed with clean/expected worktree state at each checkpoint; warnings only for non-`task/`/`codex/` issue branch and intended local changes before commit.\n\nCloses #1162\n","created_at":"2026-07-02T10:49:36Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T10:57:52Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T10:57:52Z","merged_at":"2026-07-02T10:57:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"65724f88bb7ebcb5d61b8c7987a01c9be97198ba","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1175/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1175/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1175/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/e49a2812a2e77d695c6b3d265209c8c285abe5d5","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1162","ref":"feat/issue-1162","sha":"e49a2812a2e77d695c6b3d265209c8c285abe5d5","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c